### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "author": "Frank Herbert",
  "status": "READING",
  "rating": null
}

### Create another book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Project Hail Mary",
  "author": "Andy Weir",
  "status": "FINISHED",
  "rating": 5
}